  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-title">
      <h1>Quests</h1>
      <p>Pick a quest to practice a skill that wins hackathons.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>MVP Quest</h3>
        <p class="meta">Scoping &bull; Easy, medium, or hard</p>
        <p>Cut a real winning project's wish list down to what you can actually build, then see what the winners shipped.</p>
        <span class="tag">Minimum viable product</span>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="/mvp">Play</a>
