      <article class="card">
        <h3>Team Quest</h3>
        <p class="meta">Teamwork</p>
        <p>Work with AI teammates who each have their own personality, and keep the project on track.</p>
        <span class="tag">Coming soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Judge Panel</h3>
        <p class="meta">Creeper Puncher &bull; Easy or Survival</p>
        <p>Face off against technical and business judges, answer multiple-choice questions, and punch the Creeper!</p>
        <span class="tag">Minecraft Arena</span>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="/judging">Play</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>